  "title": "Applitools | AI-Augmented Testing",
  "text": "Give Your Optimizely Devs (and Agents) Visual Guardrails to Prevent Bugs.  Save your spot for the Oct. 29th webinar\n\nWhy Applitools\nPlatform\nSolutions\nCustomers\nResources\nLogin\nStart trial\nDETERMINISTIC AI END-TO-END TESTING\nKeep AI code in check with\nproven Visual AI validation\n\nYour AI tools generate code fast, but who verifies what your customers actually see?\nApplitools completes your AI stack with human-eye precision. Backed by 4 billion proprietary training images, we eliminate false alarms so your team ships flawless UIs at scale.\n\nSchedule a demo\nStart your free trial\nFunctional\nVisual\nCross-Browser\nCross-Device\nComponent\nAccessibility\nAPI\nPDF\nTrusted by Global 1000 Brands\nTHE AGENTIC SDLC GAP\nDon't let probabilistic AI validate your AI-generated code\n\nDevelopers are using Claude, Copilot, and Cursor to build code 10x faster. But validating that code with probabilistic LLM agents creates a dangerous \"AI Black Hole\" where statistical guesswork leads to hallucinations, flaky CI pipelines, and high token costs.\n\nApplitools shines a light into this black box. By pairing a Deterministic Language Model (DLM) with mature Visual AI, we provide an objective, zero-variance governance guardrail for your development pipeline.\n\nProbabilistic AI testing\nRuntime guesswork\nHallucinations\nFlaky CI signal\nHigh token overhead\nDeterministic AI testing\n100% reproducible\nZero variance\nVisual AI accuracy\nLocal privacy\nLearn more\nCHOOSE YOUR JOURNEY\nTotal visual and functional control for developers, QA, and AI agents.\n\nWhether you're writing test code, describing user journeys in plain English, or deploying AI-generated interfaces, Applitools delivers deterministic visual ground truth across every screen. Automatically verify dynamic UI, self-heal test pipelines, and govern production releases with absolute precision.\n\nExplore the full Applitools Platform\nIntegrate Visual AI into your agents and test code\n\nDeliver visual ground truth straight to developer test suites and agentic workflows—catching UI hallucinations, broken layout hierarchies, and WCAG violations before code hits production.\n\nExplore Applitools Eyes\nRun end-to-end testing without writing code\n\nEmpower QA and manual testers to describe user journeys in plain English, using a Deterministic Language Model and Visual AI to execute self-healing tests that deliver reliable results every time.\n\nExplore Applitools Autonomous\nSECURE AND FLEXIBLE\nRun Applitools Anywhere, Test Any App. AI Built for the Enterprise.\nLearn about our AI policies\n1\nRun in our cloud\n\nGet up and running in minutes using Applitools as a SaaS solution.\n\n2\nRun in your cloud\n\nRun Applitools in a dedicated cloud on Amazon, Azure, or GCP to a flexible, secure solution.\n\n3\nDeploy on-prem\n\nDeploy Applitools on your own infrastructure, inside your firewall for maximum security.\n\n4\nISO 27001 and SOC 2 Type II\n\nApplitools products are ISO 27001 and SOC 2 Type II compliant and have current pen testing reports.\n\n5\nProprietary AI\n\nApplitools has more than a decade of training our algorithms and models for superior accuracy.\n\n6\nSSO + SAML support\n\nLogin using SSO or SAML to help eliminate administrative overhead for large teams.\n\nINTEGRATIONS\nIntegrate Applitools into  your current tech stack\n\nApplitools supports all of your workflows with integrations and a wide range of test frameworks, SCMs, CI/CD tools, bug tracking tools, chat tools, and more.\n\nSee 60+ integrations\nCUSTOMER TESTIMONIALS\n“Applitools has become essential to our process. It's helped us cut defects, speed up testing, and let our team focus on high-value work. Now, quality is truly a shared responsibility.”\nEric Terry\nSr. Director of Quality Control\n“Thanks to Applitools and Continuous Integration, release times have been cut by 75%, a huge savings across the company and a major step forward as the company redefines itself to be 'digital first.' ”\nGreg Sypolt\nQA Director\nApplitools FAQs\nWhat are the core products offered by Applitools?\nHow do I get started with Applitools?\nWhat makes Applitools different from other end-to-end testing tools?\nWhat are the pricing options for Applitools?\nReady to put deterministic guardrails on your AI-generated code?\nStart a trial\nGet a demo\nCompany\nAbout Us\nNews\nAwards\nPartners\nCustomer Case Studies\nCareers\nContact Us\nTrust Center\nProducts\nWhy Applitools\nPlatform overview\nEyes\nAutonomous\nUse Cases\nVisual testing\nAgentic testing\nFunctional testing\nMobile testing\nStorybook testing\nPDF testing\nCompliance testing\nPlaywright\nResources\nGetting started\nDocumentation\nTest Automation U\nTest Automation U Slack\nOn demand library\nCompare to others\nSupport\nBlog\nPrivacy policy\nTerms & conditions\nGDPR\nCCPA\nCookie policy\nFollow us\n©2026 Applitools\nSearch query\nUse the up and down arrows to select a result. Press enter to go to the selected search result. Touch device users can use touch and swipe gestures.\n\nBy clicking “Accept All Cookies”, you agree to the storing of cookies on your device to enhance site navigation, analyze site usage, and assist in our marketing efforts. Please read our cookie policy for a more detailed description.\n\nCookies Settings Accept All Cookies",
